      "writtenOn": "2018-01-22T12:42:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using this has a nice side effect : because the networks are marked as having been created by the system, the system can restrict networks to a set of UIDs and still see them. But this capability is not used today and it\u0027s not necessarily very useful. I\u0027m not very concerned about the point you raise, but I\u0027ll defer to your expertise so let\u0027s make that INVALID_UID.",
      "parentUuid": "4516fa46_42de47ee",
      "revId": "fe06bfcbf876966d0b6a7242e0e92dc97b1cc068",
