      "writtenOn": "2018-01-22T12:42:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed with your assessment, and fixed.\n\nI don\u0027t think we can easily let the VPN app access its own network. We\u0027d have to make it available to the VPN app without making it its default, lest we break existing behavior ; worse, at this moment the system will forcefully remove the VPN app UID from the range even if the VPN app includes it so it\u0027d be a behavior change if we\u0027d behave differently according to whether it includes itself in the ranges. I think it\u0027s likely there are VPN apps that just send a huge inclusive range without taking care of excluding themselves, and those apps would break.",
      "parentUuid": "44864aa9_d39fdc84",
      "range": {
